#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_3)
#: settingsdialog.ui:77
msgid ""
"In order to access your Facebook data in KDE, you need to authenticate this "
"application with Facebook. To do so, click the above button and follow the "
"instructions on the screen."
msgstr ""
"Wenn Du binnen KDE op Dien Facebook-Daten togriepen wullt, mutts Du dit "
"Programm bi Facebook beglöven. Wullt Du dat, klick op den Knoop baven un "
"folg de Anwiesen op den Schirm."

